flowchart TD
    Req[Incoming Microservice Call] --> CB{Circuit Breaker State}
    
    CB -- OPEN --> FastFail[Fast Fail: Return HTTP 503 / Fallback Response immediately]
    
    CB -- HALF-OPEN --> Trial[Execute Trial Request (10% Traffic)]
    Trial -- Trial Succeeds --> CloseCB[Transition to CLOSED]
    Trial -- Trial Fails --> OpenCB[Transition to OPEN]
    
    CB -- CLOSED --> Exec[Execute Call with Timeout Budget]
    
    Exec --> TimeoutCheck{Completed within Timeout?}
    
    TimeoutCheck -- No Timeout Exceeded --> TimeoutErr[Trigger Timeout Exception]
    TimeoutErr --> RetryCheck
    
    TimeoutCheck -- Yes Success --> ReturnOK[Return Successful Payload]
    
    Exec --> ResCheck{HTTP 5xx / Network Error?}
    ResCheck -- Yes --> RetryCheck{Retry Attempt < Max Retries?}
    ResCheck -- No --> ReturnOK
    
    RetryCheck -- Yes --> Backoff[Calculate Full Jitter Exponential Backoff\nt_sleep = random(0, min(t_max, t_base * 2^n))]
    Backoff --> Exec
    
    RetryCheck -- No Max Retries Exceeded --> Fallback[Trigger Fallback Strategy\n(Deferred Payment Queue / Cached Graceful Response)]
